{"unit_id":"angelky7__dsh-origin-bridge#feature-1","repo":"angelky7/dsh-origin-bridge","commit":"c6269f1fcd2c3f651850b55277beffead16d133e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Origin Bridge 的功能「导入并预览数据」：可把文本表格、Excel 工作簿和支持的工作站 .bin 文件导入 Origin；文本文件也可先解析出编码、分隔符、表头与列样本，再决定后续操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:40-57","server.py:108-130","originlab.py:684-785"]}
{"unit_id":"angelky7__dsh-origin-bridge#feature-2","repo":"angelky7/dsh-origin-bridge","commit":"c6269f1fcd2c3f651850b55277beffead16d133e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Origin Bridge 的功能「绘制和排版图表」：用户可选工作表的 X/Y 列绘制单条或多条曲线，并设置图表样式、坐标轴及图例；工具会读取部分绘图结果用于确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:84-107","originlab.py:955-1035"]}
{"unit_id":"angelky7__dsh-origin-bridge#feature-3","repo":"angelky7/dsh-origin-bridge","commit":"c6269f1fcd2c3f651850b55277beffead16d133e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Origin Bridge 的功能「曲线拟合」：可以选择线性拟合或内置的非线性拟合函数，并为非线性拟合指定参数初值、固定值和边界；拟合结果以工具响应返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:164-193","originlab.py:1563-1625"]}
{"unit_id":"angelky7__dsh-origin-bridge#feature-4","repo":"angelky7/dsh-origin-bridge","commit":"c6269f1fcd2c3f651850b55277beffead16d133e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Origin Bridge 的功能「矩阵图和科研预设」：可将二维数值矩阵绘制为热力图等模板图，也能按科研图表预设生成图形，并检查预设所需的数据列。","source":"generated","evidence":["server.py:348-420","originlab.py:1922-1980","originlab.py:2176-2214"]}
